@Platform.Auth.Gateway.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:5000

### Health
GET {{Platform.Auth.Gateway.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Signup (set FunctionInvocation:ApiKey via user-secrets or env for local runs)
POST {{Platform.Auth.Gateway.Api_HostAddress}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "<your-password>"
}

### Login
POST {{Platform.Auth.Gateway.Api_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "<your-password>"
}
